---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<Layout
  pageTitle="Author's Note"
  description="Derivative works statement, where to find me, and more!"
>
  <h1>
    <Icon
      name="openmoji:memo"
      class="mr-1 inline align-text-bottom text-5xl"
    />Author's Note
  </h1>

  <h2>Transformative Works Policy</h2>

  <p>
    Feel free to have at it with non-profit transformative works of any of my
    graphics, codes, or fics. You're welcome to take my headcanons and use them
    as your own. I do ask that you let me know if you translate, podfic, create
    fanart, etc, my work, but only because I'd like to see it, not because you
    need to ask permission.
  </p>

  <p>
    I prefer for there to be a <a
      href="https://archiveofourown.org/faq/posting-and-editing?language_id=en#archivelink"
      rel="nofollow">Related Work</a
    > link if you're posting on AO3 OR a link back to the original work on AO3 if
    at all possible!
  </p>

  <p>
    Please do not use AI to create transformative works from my works, i.e.
    please do not post videos to YouTube/TikTok/etc of AI voices reading my
    works (do it yourself! pay a voice actor! involve a real human!), especially
    if those are for profit works, including but not limited to making money
    from ad revenue!
  </p>
</Layout>
